# Retire the old LeadPages sales page: 301 the whole signup.matthewcawood.com
# subdomain to the in-house /signup landing page. Query strings (e.g. ?utm_source=…)
# are preserved by Netlify, so campaign attribution carries through to analytics.
# Dormant until signup.matthewcawood.com is attached to this site + DNS repointed.
https://signup.matthewcawood.com/*  https://app.matthewcawood.com/signup  301!
http://signup.matthewcawood.com/*   https://app.matthewcawood.com/signup  301!

# The _*.html files are working mocks and scratch pages kept alongside the app
# for reference (the progress and deep-dive mocks the Progress rebuild was
# measured against, older dashboard and glossary studies). They are not part of
